<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Land Sept 30 Q2 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Land Sept 30 Q2 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the period ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Second quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht) loss	0.15     vs  profit   0.36</p>
<p>    Net	    loss     87.63     vs  profit 214.02</p>
<p>				Six months</p>
<p>    Share (baht) profit    0.05     vs  profit   0.59</p>
<p>    Net	    profit   26.86     vs  profit 356.22</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Bangkok Land Plc, a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
